description "Clone Assassin

Dexterous troopers with stealth and frontline speciality skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 12% faster RoF
- Assassin's Vibroshivs (Dual Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Drains on hit
-- 75% more special damage
-- 20% more knockback
-- 35% shorter
-- 400% thicker
- DC-15s Clone Pistol (2)
-- Mag reload
-- Heavyweight

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Getup (2)
- 7% less knockback taken
- 50% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]"